  "observations": [
    "The outer head-to-shoulder contour is the only intended variable.",
    "Broad canopy shoulder flare obscures the hand/mitten cues; this is a design weakness of that contour in a single-color candy relief.",
    "The supplied Goat 4 favorite has a distinct broad rounded-square helmet rim, crown band, horizontal cocoa face window with happy arches, central seed, visible side mittens and shallow boot notch. The helmet control retains the most explicit rim; the broad canopy loses mitten cues, which diverges from this preference image.",
    "These are geometry-review positive solids only. No mold-release, material, food-contact or manufacturing proof."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Hands and feet are part of the shared outer polygon; the shoulder silhouette can reduce hand visibility.",
    "Faceted sampled vector curves and direct slab walls are authored geometry, not production tooling surfaces.",
    "No draft is included; 0\u00b0 is explicitly chosen to isolate shape."
  ],
